They bear and endure;
This means good fortune for inferior people.
The standstill serves to help the great man to attain success.

【Wilhelm解读】Inferior people are ready to flatter their superiors in a servile way. They would also endure the superior man if he would put an end to their confusion. This is fortunate for them. But the great man calmly bears the consequences of the standstill. He does not mingle with the crowd of the inferior;

Its coming is sudden;
It flames up, dies down, is thrown away.

